@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam componentStyle uml2

title Arsitektur Stream Pemrosesan Event Pembayaran (M7 Tantangan Mandiri)

actor "Event Producer\n(payment-events.json)" as Producer #LightCyan

package "Apache Kafka Cluster" #AliceBlue {
    node "Topic: dpw3-payment-events\n(Partition Count: 3)" as Topic {
        queue "Partition 0\n[Key: ORD-01]\nPAY-001 (CREATED)\nPAY-003 (PAID)\nPAY-006 (SHIPPED)" as P0 #LightGoldenRodYellow
        queue "Partition 1\n[Key: ORD-03]\nPAY-004 (CREATED)\nPAY-007 (PAID)" as P1 #LightPink
        queue "Partition 2\n[Key: ORD-02]\nPAY-002 (CREATED)\nPAY-005 (PAID)\nPAY-008 (SHIPPED)" as P2 #LightGreen
    }
    database "__consumer_offsets\n(Committed Offsets)" as OffsetStore #Thistle
}

package "Consumer Group: dpw3-case" #GhostWhite {
    component "Consumer Worker\n(app/consumer.py)" as Consumer #LightSalmon
    component "State Engine & Business Processing\n(FIFO per Order Validation)" as Engine #Wheat
}

' Event Ingestion & Partitioning
Producer --> P0 : Murmur2 Hash(ORD-01) -> P0\n[Strict FIFO Ordering]
Producer --> P1 : Murmur2 Hash(ORD-03) -> P1\n[Strict FIFO Ordering]
Producer --> P2 : Murmur2 Hash(ORD-02) -> P2\n[Strict FIFO Ordering]

' Consumption & Parallel/Sequential Handling
P0 --> Consumer : Fetch records sequentially
P1 --> Consumer : Fetch records sequentially
P2 --> Consumer : Fetch records sequentially

Consumer --> Engine : Process Event (State Transitions)
Engine --> Consumer : Ack Completion
Consumer --> OffsetStore : Commit Offset (At-least-once: Post-Process)

note bottom of Producer
  <b>Kunci Penentu Ordering:</b>
  Setiap event dikirim menggunakan:
  <code>key = event["order_id"]</code>
  Kafka menjamin seluruh event dengan key yang sama
  masuk ke partisi yang sama secara deterministik.
end note

note bottom of Consumer
  <b>Delivery Semantics & Failure Recovery:</b>
  • <code>enable.auto.commit = False</code>
  • Manual sync commit setelah pemrosesan record berhasil.
  • Jika terjadi crash sebelum commit (misal FAIL_AFTER),
    offset belum tersimpan, sehingga saat recovery consumer
    dapat membaca ulang dari committed offset terakhir tanpa data hilang.
end note

@enduml
